## Original Content
Apple’s Mac Mini and Mac Studio have been tough to buy for months, but updated versions have arrived. Both include new chips optimized for AI, with the M6 Mac Mini getting a $200 price bump.

## Summary
Apple has released updated versions of the Mac Mini and Mac Studio, featuring new chips optimized for AI technology. The M6 Mac Mini has a $200 price increase, and both models have been difficult to purchase for several months.

## Key Points
- Updated versions of Mac Mini and Mac Studio are now available.
- Both models include new chips optimized for AI technology.
- The M6 Mac Mini has a price increase of $200.
- The products have been scarce for months.
- The new chips are the M6 and M5 Ultra.


